WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.901
Step 1. Open the Medicine Administration sub-tab.

1.2
00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:08.223
Here you change the status or the note of a recorded dose,

1.3
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:11.108
for example to mark it Not Done.

2.1
00:00:11.108 --> 00:00:17.032
Step 2. Open the recorded dose. Find the medicine row and the time slot of the dose,

2.2
00:00:17.032 --> 00:00:22.936
then select the button with its time. Care opens the Edit Administration dialog.

3.1
00:00:22.936 --> 00:00:28.744
Step 3. Change the status. Select the Status that matches what staff did.

3.2
00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:34.041
If staff recorded the dose by mistake, select Entered in Error.

4.1
00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:39.590
Step 4. Change the note. Add or change the text in Administration Notes.

4.2
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.505
You can change only the status and the note of a saved dose.

5.1
00:00:44.505 --> 00:00:50.833
Step 5. Save your changes. Select Update. Care shows Medicine Administration saved,

5.2
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:55.507
and the colour of the dose button follows the new status.
